# Bot Maker

If the user asks to create or design a **character, bot, NPC, persona, companion, text-adventure protagonist, avatar, SillyTavern card, or tabletop-style character sheet** (stats, quirks, curses — not loot/combat rounds), read `skills/bot-maker/SKILL.md` first and follow it.

The **person** is the architecture. Bot wrapping, avatar notes, and RPG attach after.

Do not improvise a parallel character format. Schema field names live in `skills/bot-maker/references/character-schema.yaml`.
